OL,3,GNEWSAThree charged after Gosport
OL,4,Amigrant boat protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree people have been charged
OL,7,Ffollowing a protest after reports that
OL,8,Fa group of migrants crossing the
OL,9,FEnglish Channel could be taken to shore
OL,10,Fin Gosport.
OL,12,FHampshire Police deployed officers to
OL,13,Fthe town on Tuesday evening "to help
OL,14,Ffacilitate peaceful protest, ensure the
OL,15,Fsafety of the local community and
OL,16,Fsupport partners in the event of any
OL,17,Femergency at sea".
