OL,3,GNEWSAThree charged after Gosport
OL,4,Amigrant boat protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FSix people were arrested during the
OL,7,Fevening on suspected offences including
OL,8,Fassault of an emergency worker and a
OL,9,Fracially aggravated public order
OL,10,Foffence.
OL,12,FA total of 51 migrants were ultimately
OL,13,Ftaken to Dover after their boat, which
OL,14,Fhad traveled to the UK from France, was
OL,15,Fintercepted.
